        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Warning sign"><strong>Picking it purely to avoid coding, with no other plan</strong></td>
          <td data-label="What is actually true">Civil has real, growing lanes in BIM, structural design, and real estate, but only for graduates who add a modern skill layer. Avoiding code without building any other specialisation just delays the same employability problem to final year.</td>
