  <p>
    None of this means these students cannot succeed in civil engineering. It means the specific reason
    behind the choice may need a second look, and an adjacent path like architecture, a technical-sales
    role in construction materials, or a genuinely different branch, might fit better than picking civil by
    default.
  </p>

