    design, BIM, quantity surveying, real estate, PMC, and project-management roles are almost entirely
    desk- and office-based, and women hold senior positions across all of them. Only a subset of civil
    roles, active on-site execution, are genuinely site-heavy, and even there, the limiting factor is
    usually a specific employer's site culture, not the degree itself. A family worried about safety or
    travel is better served by comparing specific roles and companies than by ruling out the entire branch.
  </p>

